    "content": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Kerala fish curry serves 4 and takes about 40 minutes. Add the fish near the end so it stays soft and does not break. The "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "tamarind",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "tamarind-paste"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " and coconut give the dish its balance."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Tilt the pan and spoon the gravy over the fish rather than stirring, so it stays whole."
          }
        ]
      },
